# {{name}}

A murmur app: pieces under `pieces/` talk only through contracts in `contracts/`. `AGENTS.md` tells coding agents
where to start.

## Commands

```sh
pnpm install
pnpm exec murmur new contract <Name> --domain <file> --kind query
pnpm exec murmur new piece <path> --handles <Name>
pnpm exec murmur ctx <piece>
pnpm exec murmur check
pnpm test
pnpm lint
pnpm typecheck
pnpm dev
```
